{
  "about": "The var limits a job setting is held to, as cases (CONTRACT_ARGUS_EMPLOYEES_PHASE1 §C.2, §D.4). platform-api lib/team/definition.js varProblem and the runners' lib/team/jobState.js varInLimits (arion-api, LUMEN) must answer every case the same way, so what the job drawer says was saved is what runs. Written in platform-api and copied byte-for-byte into arion-api and LUMEN test/fixtures/, with its sha256 beside it.",
